{
  "name": "A2.2 — Cliente respondeu (alerta ao vendedor)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Depois de importar\n1. Nós Google Sheets: credencial + documento **Moveis Premium — Orcamentos** + aba indicada.\n2. No **Avisar vendedor**: trocar `COLE_AQUI_SUA_EVOLUTION_API_KEY`.\n3. **Este fluxo NÃO é chamado pela Evolution diretamente** — quem chama é o fluxo `A0 Roteador`.\n   Production URL deste webhook: `https://moderneasyn8n.duckdns.org/webhook/orcamento-resposta`\n4. Precisa estar **ATIVO** para o roteador conseguir chamá-lo.\n\n### Por que não responde ao cliente\nDe propósito: a automação **reabre a conversa**, o vendedor humano **fecha a venda**. Resposta automática aqui soaria robótica e esfriaria a negociação.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-a22",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-100, -430]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "orcamento-resposta",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a22-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook orçamento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "webhookId": "b7c1e9d2-5a44-4f31-8e02-moderneasy02",
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e1",
              "name": "telefone",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.data?.key?.remoteJid || $json.data?.key?.remoteJid || '').split('@')[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2",
              "name": "telefone8",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body?.data?.key?.remoteJid || $json.data?.key?.remoteJid || '').split('@')[0].replace(/\\D/g,'').slice(-8) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e3",
              "name": "texto",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.data?.message?.conversation || $json.data?.message?.conversation || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a22-extract",
      "name": "Extrair dados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a22-read",
      "name": "Ler aba Orcamentos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.telefone).replace(/\\D/g,'').slice(-8) }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Extrair dados').first().json.telefone8 }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "enviado",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a22-filter",
      "name": "Orçamento aberto deste cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
